ing your Filéo 3 trip\n /Indicate your departure and arrival stops\n By indicating your departure Filéo stop and your arrival Filéo stop, you will receive a confirmation of\n your reservation. If your trip involves a connection, book trip 1 and trip 2.\n 4/A confirmation is sent to you\n\nCheck your confirmation reminder showing the exact time of your Filéo sent to you no later than one hour before your trip\n. 5/Go to your Filéo stop 5 minutes before departure\n\nIn order to ensure that your reservation is properly taken care of, please arrive at your Filéo stop a little before the time indicated on your\n reservation. 6/Getting in the vehicle\n Indicate your name to the driver of the vehicle and validate your ticket\n.\nAttention! A single piece of luggage with “cabin” dimensions (55cm x 25 cm x 35cm and approximately 12kg) is accepted per traveller.\nTravelling with Filéo every day is so easy!\n\nMore information on the Filéo service by clicking here.","kind":"information","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"INFORMATION","updatedAt":"20250114T181151","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20161103T000000","end":"20301103T235900"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C01712"],"impactedStopNames":[]},{"id":"ac8bc51e-2e76-4a5f-a183-c6f05dc1e356","title":"⚠️🚍 #InfoTrafic - Lines 27, Filéo - From Monday, August 17, 2026 until the end of the work","message":"⚠️🚍 #InfoTrafic - Lines 27, Filéo - From Monday, August 17, 2026 until the end of the work\n Due to road work\n in Villiers-le-Bel, lines 27 and Filéo will be diverted in the direction of Roissyôle: ❌ The Église de Villiers-le-Bel stop will not be\n served ✅\n\nPostponement to the stops Les Lierres-Hérivaux and La Cerisaie Please excuse us for the inconvenience caused\n.","kind":"works","severity":"PERTURBEE","cause":"TRAVAUX","updatedAt":"20260814T141739","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260815T090000","end":"20270131T200000"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C01712"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C01717","sta