ittle before the time indicated on your\n reservation. 6/Getting in the vehicle\n Indicate your name to the driver of the vehicle and validate your ticket\n.\nAttention! A single piece of luggage with “cabin” dimensions (55cm x 25 cm x 35cm and approximately 12kg) is accepted per traveller.\nTravelling with Filéo every day is so easy!\n\nMore information on the Filéo service by clicking here.","kind":"information","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"INFORMATION","updatedAt":"20250114T181151","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20161103T000000","end":"20301103T235900"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C01823"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C01826","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"3ea23e2d-b1a9-4795-b23f-50149a2dd028","title":"Bus 127: Construction - Stop (s) not served","message":"Line 127 will be diverted: the stops located between Cimetière de Vincennes and Georges Clémenceau will no longer be served in the direction of Neuilly-sur-Marne — Place de la Résistance. When: from Monday, October 26, 2026, until Tuesday, November 24, 2026, until Tuesday, November 24, 2026, until Tuesday, November 24, 2026, on Mondays, Tuesdays, Wednesdays, Thursdays and Fridays from 9:30 p.m. to 4:00 a.m. Reason: work.","kind":"works","severity":"BLOQUANTE","cause":"TRAVAUX","updatedAt":"20261024T042046","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20261026T213000","end":"20261027T040000"},{"begin":"20261027T213000","end":"20261028T040000"},{"begin":"20261028T213000","end":"20261029T040000"},{"begin":"20261029T213000","end":"20261030T040000"},{"begin":"20261030T213000","end":"20261031T040000"},{"begin":"20261102T213000","end":"20261103T040000"},{"begin":"20261103T213000","end":"20261104T040000"},{"begin":"20261104T213000","end":"20261105T040000"},{"begin":"20261105T213000","end":"20261106T040000"},{"begin":"20261106T213000","end":"20261107T040000"},{"begin":"20261109T213000","end":"20261110T040000"},{"begin":"20261110T213000","end":"20261111T040000"},{"begin":"20261111T213000","en