r, you can choose:\n • contact the reservation center on 01 74 37 24 77 (call not surcharged).\n\n• use our online booking platform\n• download our free Android and iOS app\nYou will receive a confirmation within two hours of registering. 2/Book your trip\n Up to one hour before departure, you can book your trip 7 days a week, 24 hours a day.\n\nRead all the details concerning the possibilities of booking your Filéo 3 trip\n /Indicate your departure and arrival stops\n By indicating your departure Filéo stop and your arrival Filéo stop, you will receive a confirmation of\n your reservation. If your trip involves a connection, book trip 1 and trip 2.\n 4/A confirmation is sent to you\n\nCheck your confirmation reminder showing the exact time of your Filéo sent to you no later than one hour before your trip\n. 5/Go to your Filéo stop 5 minutes before departure\n\nIn order to ensure that your reservation is properly taken care of, please arrive at your Filéo stop a little before the time indicated on your\n reservation. 6/Getting in the vehicle\n Indicate your name to the driver of the vehicle and validate your ticket\n.\nAttention! A single piece of luggage with “cabin” dimensions (55cm x 25 cm x 35cm and approximately 12kg) is accepted per traveller.\nTravelling with Filéo every day is so easy!\n\nMore information on the Filéo service by clicking here.","kind":"information","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"INFORMATION","updatedAt":"20250114T181151","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20161103T000000","end":"20301103T235900"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C02060"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C02062","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"b674b088-0603-47f1-81ab-e99f89f01bdf","title":"⚠🚍 Lines 613, 700 - From Monday, October 19 to Friday, November 6, 2026","message":"⚠🚍 Lines 613, 700 - From Monday, October 19 to Friday, November 6, 2026\n Due to construction on Westinghouse Boulevard in Sevran, lines 613 and 700 are diverted\n in both directions